{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2021-12-08 18:01:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP ANNOUNCES 2022 ANNUAL MEETING DATE', 'text': "CHICAGO, DEC. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CME GROUP INC. (NASDAQ: CME), THE WORLD'S LEADING AND MOST DIVERSE DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL CONDUCT ITS 2022 ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS AT 10:00 A.M. CENTRAL TIME ON WEDNESDAY, MAY 4, 2022."}